  "worked_solution": "A set is a subset of $A$ if all its elements are elements of $A.$ \n\nWith that in mind, let's inspect each option.\n\n- ${-1,{12}}$ is *not* a subset of $A$ because it contains the element $-1\\notin A.\\,\\times $\n\n- ${{20,22}}$ is a subset of $A.\\,\u2713$\n\n- ${{0},{6,9,15}}$ is *not* a subset of $A$ because it contains the element ${0}\\notin A.\\,\\times $\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\".",
